<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_jia_wood_the_pioneer', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Jia Wood – The Pioneer', 'zh' => '身强甲木'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Empowered Jia Wood is like a towering tree – strong, ambitious, and full of vitality. Naturally blessed with a pioneering spirit and unwavering integrity, Empowered Jia Wood is driven to expand and lead. However, remember that a single tree does not make a forest. True strength lies not in growing alone, but in thriving through mutual support and interdependence with others. Embracing collaboration will transform your raw power into sustainable growth.</p><p>Leadership charisma: Decisive and commanding, Empowered Jia Wood naturally rally others and excel at seeing the big picture.<br/>      Straightforward communication: Honest and direct in speech – just be mindful of others’ feelings when expressing yourself.<br/>      Resilient and courageous: Beneath a strong exterior lies a kind heart. In critical moments,Empowered Jia Wood dare to break through barriers and innovate.<br/>      Highly action-oriented: Empowered Jia Wood execute plans swiftly. Learn to temper impulsiveness when making major decisions.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Metal, Fire, and Earth. These elements help balance Empowered Jia Wood’s abundant Wood energy and keep Empowered Jia Wood grounded. Leveraging Metal’s focus, Fire’s inspiration, and Earth’s stability allows Empowered Jia Wood’s strengths to shine more steadily.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You have lifetime potential to earn great wealth, but money may come as quickly as it goes. It\'s crucial to learn when to exercise financial restraint. Profiting through controlled leverage, real estate investments, or monetizing innovations can serve you well – just avoid blindly following speculative fads.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Prone to muscle and bone fatigue, you should avoid sitting or standing for too long and stretch regularly. Watch out for sudden cardiovascular issues by keeping a consistent routine and managing stress. Maintaining a balanced lifestyle will help sustain your energy.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You often feel a wave of anxiety after making major decisions and tend to bottle up stress rather than share it. To protect your mental health, find active outlets for release: competitive sports like fencing or rock climbing can burn off excess tension, and strategy games let you satisfy your need for control in a safe way. Regularly venting your drive through such channels keeps you emotionally balanced.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Recommended Industries: Judiciary & Public Safety: Judge, prosecutor, police officer, military officer, firefighter. Metal & Precision Manufacturing: Machinery, automotive, aerospace, semiconductors, precision instruments. Management & Consulting: Strategic consulting, corporate management, auditing. Technology & Internet: Software development, artificial intelligence, big data, gaming, social media. Education & Training: Higher education, vocational training, online education. Creative & Media: Advertising, PR, film production, design, publishing, entertainment. Real Estate & Construction: Property development, architecture, civil engineering, interior design. Finance & Investment: Banking, securities, investment funds, asset management, insurance. Mining & Agriculture: Mineral exploration, mining operations, modern farming, land management. Retail & Trade: Commodity trading, brand retail (especially brick-and-mortar stores). Industries to Avoid: Fishing & Aquaculture: Routine, patience-heavy work. Maritime Shipping: Slow-moving industry. Psychological Counseling: Requires delicate sensitivity. Social Work & Nonprofits: Bureaucratic pace. Forestry: Slow growth and detail work. Textile & Garment Manufacturing: Repetitive processes.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Geng Metal: A clear-eyed friend who points out your blind spots, preventing you from rushing into pitfalls.</li><li>Bing Fire: An enthusiastic friend who helps turn your lofty ideas into reality and combat your tendency to procrastinate.</li><li>Wu Earth: A reliable connector who introduces you to valuable networks and resources, boosting your growth.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Xin Metal: A complementary partner who brings out your best. Empowered Jia Wood handle big-picture strategy while Xin Metal refines the details, making the partnership productive.</li><li>Ding Fire: A supportive partner who ignites Empowered Jia Wood’s creativity at just the right moments, inspiring Empowered Jia Wood with warmth and passion.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jane Goodall: A pioneering primatologist and UN Messenger of Peace known for fearless leadership in her field</li><li>John Legend: Singer and social activist who boldly uses his platform for change</li><li>Billie Jean King: Tennis legend who led the charge for gender equality in sports (\'Battle of the Sexes\')</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Tu Youyou: Scientist who discovered artemisinin, the first Chinese Nobel laureate in medicine (a trailblazer saving millions of lives)</li><li>Han Hong: Singer and philanthropist recognized for boldly leading disaster relief and charity efforts</li><li>Jia Zhangke: Renowned film director who carved out a new wave in Chinese cinema with visionary storytelling</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Listen to heavy metal music to boost your energy and confidence</li><li>Chew mint-flavored gum to calm anxiety and sharpen focus</li><li>Include more white-colored foods in your diet (like pears, radish, cauliflower) for good luck and vitality</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Red & Purple (Fire): These passionate hues ignite your motivation and creativity. Using red or purple accents (a notebook, accessory, or decor) is like \'adding fuel to your fire,\' helping you stay inspired and driven.</li><li>Yellow (Earth): A color of stability and foundation. Touches of yellow keep you grounded – much like rich soil supporting a tree. Surround yourself with some yellow (clothing, decor) to feel secure and help your grand plans take root.</li><li>White (Metal): The color of clarity and focus. For Empowered Jia Wood, white acts like a guiding light, helping you cut through confusion and pour your unstoppable energy into real achievements. Keep a touch of white nearby – a journal, a candle, or even your outfit – to feel sharp, decisive, and ready to conquer.</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>West (Metal): Facing west helps you focus and rein in your expansive energy. Westward orientation sharpens your judgment and decisiveness, guiding you toward clear decisions.</li><li>South (Fire): Southern energy sparks creativity and enthusiasm. Spend time facing south or decorate the south area of your space with items you love – it will naturally kindle inspiration and fresh ideas.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>甲木如同参天大树，力量充盈，气势昂扬，天生带有开拓与成长的特质。木性刚直，内心坚定不屈。但需要明白，单木难成林，真正的强大不在于独立生长，而在于懂得万物相生相依、互助共荣的法则。</p><p>领袖气质：自带号召力，处事果断，擅长统筹全局。<br/>言语直率：坦诚明快，沟通时需兼顾他人感受。<br/>坚韧果敢：外表强势，内心怀善，关键时刻敢于破局创新。<br/>行动力超群：执行迅速，重大决策时警惕盲目冒进。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强甲木，喜用金、火、土。如果能顺势运用这些元素，就能让自己的力量更平衡，也更容易发挥长处。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>一辈子能赚大钱，但钱来得猛去得快，关键得学会刹车。可通过风险可控的杠杆运作、不动产投资、专利技术进行变现，但切勿盲目跟风投机。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>筋骨容易疲劳，不要久坐久站，适当拉伸和休息；小心突发性心脑血管问题，作息规律，保持心情平稳。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>在重大决策后会产生焦虑情绪，面对压力通常不愿意向他人诉说来释放高压情绪。为了心理健康，可以定期进行对抗性运动（击剑/攀岩），通过战略类游戏释放掌控欲。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：司法与公共安全业：法院、检察院、警察、军队、消防。金属与精密制造业：钢铁、机械、汽车制造、航空航天、精密仪器、半导体芯片。管理与咨询业：战略咨询、企业管理咨询、审计。科技与互联网业：软件开发、人工智能、大数据、游戏、社交媒体。教育与培训业：高等教育、职业培训、在线教育。创意与传媒业：广告、公关、影视制作、设计、出版、演艺、娱乐。房地产与建筑业：房地产开发、建筑设计、土木工程、室内装修。金融与投资业：银行、证券、投资、基金、资产管理、保险。矿业与农业：矿产开采、地质勘探、现代农业、土地资源管理。零售与贸易业：大宗商品贸易、品牌零售（尤其是实体店）。慎重行业：渔业、水产养殖业、航运、心理咨询、社会工作、非营利组织、林业、纺织、服装制造。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>庚金：做重大决定前可以多问身边的庚金朋友，庚金可以精准指出你的思维盲区，让你避免踩坑。</li><li>丙火：能够帮助你把天马行空的想法落地，对抗拖延症。</li><li>戊土：能够帮你引荐各种人脉资源，助力你的事业发展。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>辛金：辛金作为伴侣能够在相处中发掘你的优点。在具体事情中，你负责战略推进，辛金负责打磨细节。</li><li>丁火：丁火作为辅助型伴侣，可以恰到好处地激发你的创意。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jane Goodall：黑猩猩研究先驱，联合国和平大使</li><li>John Legend：歌手与社会活动家</li><li>Billie Jean King：网球名将，发起\'性别之战\'比赛推动男女同酬</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>屠呦呦：发现青蒿素，首位获诺贝尔生理学或医学奖的中国本土科学家</li><li>韩红：歌手，长期支援灾区医疗、贫困儿童救助</li><li>贾樟柯：知名导演</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>多听重金属音乐</li><li>嚼薄荷味口香糖可以平复情绪</li><li>多吃白色食物</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>红色 / 紫色（火）：木生火，火象征着热情与动力。红色和紫色能点燃行动力，让人更有干劲，也更容易激发灵感。</li><li>黄色（土）：土能承载万物，象征稳定和根基。黄色能帮助甲木更稳、更踏实，不会光长枝叶而忽略了基础。</li><li>白色（金）：白色能带来决断力与纪律性，帮助身强甲木克制散漫，目标明确，将旺盛的精力用于突破难关。</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>西方（金）：金能让木学会收敛与专注。面向西方时，更容易增强判断力和决断力，帮你更快定下方向。</li><li>南方（火）：南方的能量能激发灵感与创造力。如果需要新的想法或创意，可以多面向南方，或者在南方位置布置一些喜欢的物件。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
